WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:04.053
Tala's parents are from the Philippines.

2
00:00:04.054 --> 00:00:08.003
They are Filipino.

3
00:00:08.004 --> 00:00:13.862
When I go to her house, we eat shaved ice.

4
00:00:13.863 --> 00:00:17.872
It is sweet and delicious.

5
00:00:17.873 --> 00:00:21.733
Carolina's parents are from Germany.

6
00:00:21.734 --> 00:00:24.828
They are German.

7
00:00:24.829 --> 00:00:30.025
When I play at her house, we eat sausage!

8
00:00:30.026 --> 00:00:35.214
It is salty and delicious.

9
00:00:35.215 --> 00:00:38.683
Uri's parents are from Israel.

10
00:00:38.684 --> 00:00:42.171
They are Israeli.

11
00:00:42.172 --> 00:00:47.585
When he comes over, he brings sesame snacks.

12
00:00:47.586 --> 00:00:51.839
They are crunchy and delicious!

13
00:00:51.840 --> 00:00:55.480
Elsa's parents are from Sweden.

14
00:00:55.481 --> 00:00:59.201
They are Swedish.

15
00:00:59.202 --> 00:01:04.446
When I go to her house, we eat rice pudding.

16
00:01:04.447 --> 00:01:09.546
It is creamy and delicious.

17
00:01:09.547 --> 00:01:15.682
Tala, Carolina, Uri, Elsa, and I are in the same class.

18
00:01:15.683 --> 00:01:20.080
We are all friends.

